; Scales, in ones and twos. The three lair dragons drop them in sixes and tens, so this is the slow
; way to the same currency — the drakescale mail costs enough scales that you either hunt a boss or
; you hunt drakes for a while, and both are meant to be real answers.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Entry_scale"]
script = ExtResource("2_entry")
ItemId = "item.material.dragon_scale"
DropChance = 0.85
MinQuantity = 1
MaxQuantity = 2
